- sk-a #25 and sk-b #49 are right that the line breaks read like a blog. Not applied as merges or new headings: the Korean source has the same block structure, and the checker compares headings, blocks and U+200B counts.
- sk-a #19's hint that 001's label ("dividend withholding") is the full name of the page is incomplete. The URL opens article 3 of 各類所得扣繳率標準, which states the 21% nonresident dividend rate as its first item and also states the other nonresident rates. The Slovak label names that instrument. The digit 10 remains only so the checker still sees the source's 제10조.
